description:
@Za-Chary* for the original project!\
@qucchia for the mobile-friendly platformer tutorial!\
The Scratch Wiki for the \when stop sign clicked\" workaround!\

The sound is exactly two seconds long.\
\
@qucchia for the random decimal number trick

The sprite to go off the project window scripts were by me and the inspiration was @FUNUT (see my other project for more info)\
\
Thanks to @TheLogFather for the initialize/start broadcast idea — the Scratch API (https://api.scratch.mit.edu) for helping me as to whether or not the usernames contained capital i (I)'s, lowercase L (l)'s, or both — and @joshiesays for the recursive thumbnail tutorial (I modified the scripts, so that it starts on the broadcasts and not directly the green flag).\
\
